{"speciesId":601,"names":{"fr":"Cliticlic","es":"Klinklang","en":"Klinklang","ja":"ギギギアル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son noyau rouge lui permet d’accumuler de l’énergie qu’il projette ensuite aux alentours grâce à ses pics."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its red core functions as an energy tank. It fires the charged energy through its spikes into an area."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il accumule rapidement de l’énergie en faisant tourner très vite le rouage qui contient son noyau rouge."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The gear with the red core is rotated at high speed for a rapid energy charge."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The minigear spins at high speed. Then the energy from the red core charges the minigear to make it ready to fire."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The minigear spins at high speed. Then the energy from the red core charges the minigear to make it ready to fire."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il accumule rapidement de l’énergie en faisant tourner très vite le rouage qui contient son noyau rouge."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Recarga su energía rápidamente haciendo girar con gran celeridad el engranaje equipado con un núcleo rojo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The gear with the red core is rotated at high speed for a rapid energy charge."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"赤い コアの ついた ギアを 高速回転させて エネルギーを 急速チャージ するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son noyau rouge lui permet d’accumuler de l’énergie qu’il projette ensuite aux alentours grâce à ses pics."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El núcleo rojo sirve como depósito de la energía que expulsa por las púas una vez que está cargado."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its red core functions as an energy tank. It fires the charged energy through its spikes into an area."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"赤い コアは エネルギータンクの 役割。チャージし